##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene The phase 1 reference scene, said in RIB
version 3.03
Format 64 48 1
Projection "orthographic"
# the defaults are RI_EPSILON and RI_INFINITY, which leave the orthographic depth scale at
# about 2e-38 and collapse every z onto the near plane
Clipping 1 100
WorldBegin
# the shader that means no shading, named rather than defaulted to: this picture is what
# the tree drew before there was a language, and naming it is what says the language draws
# the same thing
Surface "constant"
# asymmetric about both axes, so a flipped picture is a failing one. No Color, so it takes the
# RI default of white - which is what the code built scene renders
Polygon "P" [-0.7 -0.2 5  0.3 -0.2 5  0.3 0.8 5  -0.7 0.8 5]
WorldEnd
